        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆工人",
          "text": "費斯特，你別怪凱瑟琳。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆工人",
          "text": "你不在的這一年，都是凱瑟琳和那些薩卡茲周旋，我們廠才能做到一個人都沒少。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆工人",
          "text": "有一次差點就出事了，她甚至鬧到了城防軍的領袖過來調解。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆工人",
          "text": "但是，最近，薩卡茲們催得越來越緊了，凱瑟琳也很難做。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "......我知道，帕特。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "我怎麼可能怪奶奶。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "當我加入自救軍，當我真正瞭解到我將面對什麼後，我才真正理解......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "奶奶當時做出的決定，有多困難。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱瑟琳",
          "text": "好了，說吧，這次回來是做什麼的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "我們是來找東西的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱瑟琳",
          "text": "東西？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "沒錯，薩卡茲有一條隱藏的補給線，以此支撐著他們的瘋狂戰爭。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "而補給線的終點，我們現在確定，就在這片工業區中。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "text": "我們要找到那條補給線。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
